		{"id":"bff5f0f228d58ecf","type":"text","text":"<center> Which planetary-health competencies are relevant to contemporary general practice and how can educational interventions addressing these competencies be co-designed and implemented within existing Flemish GP training structures</center>","x":35,"y":448,"width":506,"height":329},
